			"Message": "test(Maintain): split integration tests into Syntactic and Integration suites\n\nSplit the original Eliminate integration tests into two binary-compatible\nsuites: Syntactic (for fast, string-based comparison) and Integration\n(for semantically-validating via rustc).  The integration suite now compiles\ntransformed snippets to validate semantic equivalence.\n\nThis separation allows for faster, more targeted testing of the elimination\nlogic (syntactic) versus real-world usage (integration) and improves\nmaintainability by modularising the test files.\n\nRename `tests/Eliminate.rs` → `tests/Eliminate/Syntactic.rs` and\nintroduce `tests/Eliminate/Integration.rs` with per-test files under\n`tests/Eliminate/Integration/`.  Both test suites are built by `cargo test`.",
			"SHA": "ad03561e6603ff1f089e8e4fa4859c9a2ad3f24c"
		}
